      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "With a history of over 55 years in residential property sales in Lucan, McDonald Property are delighted to present No. 20 Castlegate Way to the market.\n\nThis impressive 2-bedroom duplex end of terrace house is presented in excellent condition throughout, having been meticulously maintained by its current owners.\n\nIt is enhanced by a bright dual-aspect living area with access to private patio area at rear, and overlooking amenity green at rear.\n\n \n\nExtending to approximately 1,035 square feet, this spacious two-bedroom home offers well-proportioned accommodation throughout. The layout comprises an entrance hall with both storage and access to a contemporary shaker style kitchen complete with gas hob, and a generous living room with extra-large windows.\n\nUpstairs there are two large bedrooms, including a primary bedroom with en-suite, as well as a main bathroom and storage cupboard.\n\n \n\nNo. 20 Castlegate Way enjoys an exceptionally convenient and well-connected location. The development is serviced by the C1, L53 and P29 bus routes, while the N4, N7 and M50 are easily accessible, ensuring excellent connectivity to Dublin and beyond. Adamstown Railway Station is within comfortable walking distance providing regular services to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas.\n\nResidents benefit from immediate access to The Crossings retail area, home to Aldi, Tesco, ABC Gym, Belfry Co. Cafe and a range of additional amenities. Lucan Village, SuperValu and Liffey Valley Shopping Centre are all within easy reach, offering an extensive selection of shopping and dining options.\n\nThe property is also ideally positioned close to a wide choice of well-regarded schools, including Adamstown Community College, Lucan Community College, St. John the Evangelist National School and Adamstown Castle Educate Together. For outdoor recreation, Airlie Park and Tandy's Park Playground are nearby, providing generous green spaces for leisure and relaxation.\n\n \n\nACCOMMODATION: \n\nEntrance Hall: with wood-effect water proof laminate flooring, understairs storage unit (with shelving and with window to side), mounted shoe storage unit, alarm point\n\nLiving Room: to front of house with wood-effect waterproof laminate flooring, vertically mounted radiator, large window to front, bespoke soft-closing sliding door between living room and kitchen\n\nKitchen: with extensive range of country-style white kitchen units at floor- and eye-level, tiled splash back, 4-ring gas hob, Bosch integrated oven, Bosch fridge / freezer, wall mounted vertical radiator, Ideal gas boiler, window blinds, bespoke additional seating bench\n\nDownstairs Bathroom: fully tiled floor, wc, whb, ventilation point\n\n \n\nUPSTAIRS:\n\nBedroom 1: Master to front of property, fitted wardrobes, laminate flooring, curtains\n\nEnsuite: Tiled floor, wc, whb, fully tiled shower unit, 2 x mounted vnity units, mounted mirrored cabinet, ventilation point\n\nBedroom 2: to rear of property with laminate flooring, fitted wardrobes, blinds, shelving\n\nFamily Bathroom: fully tiled floor, wc, whb, and bath tub.\n\nHotpress: for additional shelving\n\n REAR:\n\nFenced in paved patio area accessed via kitchen\n\nShed included in sale\n\nAdjacent well-maintained amenity green\n\nAmple communal parking to rear\n\n \n\nMeasurements provided are approximate and intended for guidance. Descriptions, photographs and floor plans are provided for illustrative and guidance purposes. Errors, omissions, inaccuracies, or mis-descriptions in these materials do not entitle any party to claims, actions, or compensation against McDonald Property or the vendor. Prospective buyers or interested parties are responsible for conducting their own due diligence, inspections, or other inquiries to verify the accuracy of the information provided. McDonald Property have not tested any appliances, apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Prospective buyers or interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these."
